   exceptions="Temporary loaner equipment may be issued for short-term needs and tracked separately. Lost, stolen, or damaged devices must be reported immediately so they can be remotely locked and wiped, and unreturned equipment at departure is escalated to the manager and Human Resources.",
   records="Asset assignments, configurations, return inspections, and secure-wipe confirmations are retained according to operating standards for audit and lifecycle management. Records support security investigations and are kept until the asset is retired and disposed of.",
