   exceptions="Emergency infrastructure changes follow expedited approval with security notification and post-change review. Any rule or change that opens external access without the required security review is treated as a serious security violation and escalated immediately.",
   records="Change designs, approvals, security reviews, and outcomes are retained according to operating standards for audit. Firewall rules are documented with an owner and review date, and records are kept per retention requirements.",
