   procedure="When responding, staff first log the inquiry in the internal system and verify the customer's identity and entitlement before sharing account-related information, using approved response templates for common questions. Sensitive or non-standard responses are reviewed or approved by the responsible department before sending, complex cases are escalated, and follow-ups are linked to the original case.",
